sam3rs
Copyright 2026 Praveen Perera

sam3rs is an independent Rust/CUDA implementation of Meta's SAM 3 image model.
It contains no SAM 3 weights. The weights are Meta's, under the SAM License,
and download from an unchanged mirror of facebook/sam3 at
https://huggingface.co/avencera/sam3-safetensors, which carries a copy of that
license.
